{"parse": {"title": "迷思之茧·37", "pageid": 150135, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"迷思之茧·37\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/Item-644001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"迷思之茧·37\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>迷思之茧·37</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#644001</div></div><hr /><div>纠缠的、闪亮的脑海奇想，你曾遗失的，令指尖震颤狂喜的灵感。用于唤起37的闪念，并将37的狂想等级直升至MAX。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">似曾相识的美梦，反复唤起的灵感，你不曾见过它，却能辨别出某些熟悉的影子。海水无垠，那当真是你所想之物么？</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "迷思之茧·37"}}